 r←Test_ProcessTool_009(stopFlag batchFlag);rc;parms;n;list;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "ProcessTool". There is no "Process" button. Processing is triggered by a double-click.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.posn←30 40
 list←('one' 'two' 'three' 'four' 'five' 'six' 'seven' 'eight' 'nine'),[0.5]1+⍳9
 parms.default←(1+⍳9)∊3 5
 parms.style←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.single
 parms.info←'Checks whether a double-click works as intended.'
 parms.processBtnCaption←''
 parms.dblClick←1
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.ProcessTool.Create list'∆HarvestSelections'
 ⎕DL 0.3
 1 ⎕NQ n.List'ItemDblClick' 2 0 0 8
 →GoToTidyUp n.∆result≢,⊂list[,2;]
 →GoToTidyUp 1≠⍴n.∆buttons
 r←∆OK
∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
